<title>UK: Norway Statfjord loadings delayed three days - trade.</title>
<headline>Norway Statfjord loadings delayed three days - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>August loadings of Norwegian Statfjord crude have been put back by three days and two of the 28 cargoes originally scheduled will now load in September, trading sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;A new programme was issued yesterday,&quot; said a trader.</p>
<p>&quot;August loadings have been delayed by three days and two cargoes have been moved into September,&quot; the trader added.</p>
<p>The delays resulted from unscheduled shutdowns at the Snorre and Statfjord C fields, traders said.</p>
</text>
